"{\n \"html\": \"<div class=\\\"module our-approach full-width\\\"> <div class=\\\"background\\\"> <div class=\\\"background-image\\\" style=\\\"background-image: url(&quot;&quot;); background-position-y: 2.0592px;\\\"></div> <div class=\\\"background-color\\\"></div> </div> <div class=\\\"container\\\"> <h2 class=\\\"title module-title\\\" id=\\\"approach\\\">Approach</h2> <div class=\\\"our-approach-description module-description wysiwyg-content\\\"> A proven four-step process empowers us to understand your audience, brand, and business goals to create a plan for success. </div> <div class=\\\"our-approach-content\\\"> <div class=\\\"our-approach-animation\\\" config=\\\"{&quot;first_slide_url&quot; : &quot;//f.hubspotusercontent30.net/hubfs/2211982/raw_assets/public/FreeRange/images/explore_bird/explore_bird_00000.png&quot;, &quot;count&quot; : &quot;193&quot; }\\\" style=\\\"top: 227.086px;\\\"> <div class=\\\"inner-container\\\"> <canvas width=\\\"732\\\" height=\\\"445\\\"></canvas> </div> </div> <div class=\\\"steps\\\"> <div class=\\\"step\\\"> <h3 data-number=\\\"1\\\" class=\\\"text-start\\\">Understand</h3> <div class=\\\"description\\\"><p>We begin with a deep dive into the context of your problem, uncovering the hidden factors that influence your organization, audience, and market. We search your world to find the best opportunities for you<span>—and reveal the heart of your story.</span></p></div> <div class=\\\"tags\\\"> <span class=\\\"tag\\\">Discovery &amp; Research</span> <span class=\\\"tag\\\">User Stories</span> <span class=\\\"tag\\\">Creative Direction</span> <span class=\\\"tag\\\">Product Roadmap</span> <span class=\\\"tag\\\">Workshops</span> <span class=\\\"tag\\\">Focus Groups</span> <span class=\\\"tag\\\">Brand Strategy</span> </div> </div> <div class=\\\"step\\\"> <h3 data-number=\\\"2\\\">Explore</h3> <div class=\\\"description\\\"><p>Equipped with a thorough understanding of the challenge at hand, we dig between the cracks and below the surface to identify ways we can best meet your audience's needs. This is a time to think big<span>—</span>but also to focus in on the opportunities we can realize for you here and now.</p></div> <div class=\\\"tags\\\"> <span class=\\\"tag\\\">Moodboards</span> <span class=\\\"tag\\\">Concepts</span> <span class=\\\"tag\\\">Information Architecture</span> <span class=\\\"tag\\\">Ideation</span> <span class=\\\"tag\\\">Design Thinking</span> </div> </div> <div class=\\\"step\\\"> <h3 data-number=\\\"3\\\" class=\\\"text-start\\\">Create</h3> <div class=\\\"description\\\"><p>Sure of our direction<span>—and grounded in the realities of your unique situation—w</span>e develop a detailed strategy to help you fulfill your goals. Here, we craft the powerful mix of word, image, and technology that will solve your problems...and make your story irresistible.</p></div> <div class=\\\"tags\\\"> <span class=\\\"tag\\\">Prototype</span> <span class=\\\"tag\\\">Minimum Viable Product</span> <span class=\\\"tag\\\">Development</span> <span class=\\\"tag\\\">Brand Identity</span> <span class=\\\"tag\\\">Video Production</span> <span class=\\\"tag\\\">Animation</span> <span class=\\\"tag\\\">Illustrations</span> <span class=\\\"tag\\\">Graphic Design</span> <span class=\\\"tag\\\">Package Design</span> <span class=\\\"tag\\\">UX/UI Design</span> <span class=\\\"tag\\\">Event Design</span> <span class=\\\"tag\\\">Display Design</span> <span class=\\\"tag\\\">Copywriting</span> <span class=\\\"tag\\\">Scripts</span> </div> </div> <div class=\\\"step\\\"> <h3 data-number=\\\"4\\\">Launch</h3> <div class=\\\"description\\\"><p>We test and refine our solutions, optimizing for outcomes. After the initial launch, we'll team up to figure out what's working, and what needs to be tweaked. Together, we'll build the best possible future for your organization.</p></div> <div class=\\\"tags\\\"> <span class=\\\"tag\\\">Go-to-Market</span> <span class=\\\"tag\\\">Analytics</span> <span class=\\\"tag\\\">Strategy</span> <span class=\\\"tag\\\">Product Sprints</span> <span class=\\\"tag\\\">Planning</span> </div> </div> </div> </div> </div> </div>\",\n \"tree\": {\n  \"tag\": \"div\",\n  \"cls\": \"module our-approach full-width\",\n  \"rect\": [\n   0,\n   1889,\n   1440,\n   3108\n  ],\n  \"styles\": {\n   \"position\": \"relative\",\n   \"left\": \"608px\",\n   \"right\": \"-608px\",\n   \"width\": \"1440px\",\n   \"height\": \"3108px\",\n   \"backgroundColor\": \"rgb(240, 249, 253)\",\n   \"backgroundPosition\": \"0% 0%\",\n   \"backgroundRepeat\": \"repeat\",\n   \"padding\": \"60px 0px 0px\",\n   \"margin\": \"0px 0px 0px -720px\",\n   \"display\": \"block\",\n   \"flexDirection\": \"row\",\n   \"fontFamily\": \"\\\"Work Sans\\\"\",\n   \"fontSize\": \"19px\",\n   \"fontWeight\": \"500\",\n   \"color\": \"rgb(74, 74, 74)\",\n   \"lineHeight\": \"28px\",\n   \"border\": \"0px none rgb(74, 74, 74)\",\n   \"borderBottom\": \"0px none rgb(74, 74, 74)\",\n   \"borderTop\": \"0px none rgb(74, 74, 74)\",\n   \"opacity\": \"1\",\n   \"transition\": \"all\",\n   \"textAlign\": \"start\",\n   \"marginLeft\": \"-720px\",\n   \"paddingTop\": \"60px\",\n   \"flex\": \"0 1 auto\",\n   \"flexWrap\": \"nowrap\",\n   \"listStyle\": \"outside none disc\"\n  },\n  \"children\": [\n   {\n    \"tag\": \"div\",\n    \"cls\": \"background\",\n    \"rect\": [\n     8,\n     1889,\n     1440,\n     3108\n    ],\n    \"styles\": {\n     \"position\": \"absolute\",\n     \"left\": \"8px\",\n     \"right\": \"-8px\",\n     \"width\": \"1440px\",\n     \"height\": \"3108px\",\n     \"backgroundPosition\": \"0% 0%\",\n     \"backgroundRepeat\": \"repeat\",\n     \"display\": \"block\",\n     \"flexDirection\": \"row\",\n     \"fontFamily\": \"\\\"Work Sans\\\"\",\n     \"fontSize\": \"19px\",\n     \"fontWeight\": \"500\",\n     \"color\": \"rgb(74, 74, 74)\",\n     \"letterSpacing\": \"-0.5px\",\n     \"lineHeight\": \"28px\",\n     \"border\": \"0px none rgb(74, 74, 74)\",\n 